  "slot": "# Installed root:root 0644. Host policy and payload are separately provisioned.\n[Unit]\nDescription=Swarma demo station slot lifecycle\nAfter=local-fs.target nss-user-lookup.target\nStartLimitIntervalSec=60\nStartLimitBurst=3\n\n[Service]\nType=exec\nUser=root\nGroup=root\nUMask=0077\nWorkingDirectory=/\nExecStart=/usr/libexec/swarma-slotd-demo -policy /etc/swarma-slotd-demo/policy.json\nRestart=on-failure\nRestartSec=2\nTimeoutStopSec=45\nKillMode=control-group\nStandardInput=null\nStandardOutput=journal\nStandardError=journal\nEnvironment=PATH=/usr/sbin:/usr/bin LANG=C LC_ALL=C\nUnsetEnvironment=LD_PRELOAD LD_LIBRARY_PATH LD_AUDIT GLIBC_TUNABLES GCONV_PATH LOCPATH\nNoNewPrivileges=yes\nRestrictRealtime=yes\nLockPersonality=yes\n# Keep host account databases, mounts, /proc, netlink and systemd visible.\n# Payload sandboxing and caps belong to each separate transient slot unit.\n\n[Install]\nWantedBy=multi-user.target\n",
